{
  "slug": "vanta",
  "name": "Vanta",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The Vanta plugin connects Claude Code to Vanta's security and compliance platform through the Vanta MCP server. It combines Vanta's test-specific remediation intelligence with your local repository context to help you fix compliance failures faster.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **3 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `fix-test` (Fix a failing Vanta compliance test by generating code changes and opening a pull request), `list-tests` (Show failing Vanta compliance tests, prioritized by what can be fixed from this repository), `test-remediation` (Fix failing Vanta compliance tests using code)\n- **MCP servers** (3): `vanta-us`, `vanta-eu`, `vanta-aus`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install vanta@claude-plugins-official` from `VantaInc/vanta-mcp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
